**Build played:** release `playtest-4` in world/producer, `snake-playtest-4.zip` (game-developer f84f9d3 + artist 766d875), served from `snake-pt4/` on port 8004. Diff against playtest-3: only the 500 ms Game Over hold (`OVER_GUARD_MS`, disabled Play again button) plus README/test text — I diffed the two unzipped trees to confirm.
